{"about_the_game":"<strong>Brutal Management</strong> is a game about growing your own business, where any sense of order depends entirely on your decisions, your willpower, and your ability to handle everything that suddenly goes wrong.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1867075a116eb622129f51f03f67eb6e.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1867075a116eb622129f51f03f67eb6e.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1867075a116eb622129f51f03f67eb6e.mp4?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You\u2019re in charge of everything \u2014 and everyone. Your team is fully at your disposal: direct them, command them, push them to work, or force them into action if you must. But remember \u2014 they\u2019re not mindless machines. They have moods, reactions, and their own understanding of what\u2019s happening.<br>They behave naturally and unpredictably because they\u2019re driven by <strong>physics</strong> and their interaction with the world \u2014 and that\u2019s exactly why they feel so <strong>alive</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1e350f2b7a6533108125377771c349ee.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1e350f2b7a6533108125377771c349ee.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1e350f2b7a6533108125377771c349ee.mp4?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This isn\u2019t a boring simulator where you drown in routine. There\u2019s always something happening: events shift rapidly, plans fall apart, and the environment constantly keeps you on your toes. You\u2019ll encounter funny moments, unexpected reactions, a lively workspace, and even a dog who interferes with the workflow as if it\u2019s written into his job description.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1f1b5ab6df726f0038417d600df5af83.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1f1b5ab6df726f0038417d600df5af83.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1f1b5ab6df726f0038417d600df5af83.mp4?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your goal is simple: <strong>develop your business</strong>, earn money, upgrade your tools, and unlock new opportunities. Every day brings a new story \u2014 and none of them will be calm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/f5a023d51474d79e87348e2bf0b2e461.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/f5a023d51474d79e87348e2bf0b2e461.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/f5a023d51474d79e87348e2bf0b2e461.mp4?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Brutal Management</strong> is about control, physics, living workers, and a continuous stream of events that won\u2019t let you get bored for even a minute.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135820?t=1764387753","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135820?t=1764387753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/9f81d611d20c64cbc1dcff15657e87cf2328f367/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764387753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/9f81d611d20c64cbc1dcff15657e87cf2328f367/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764387753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game includes mild comedic violence and physical interactions between characters, such as pushing, slapping, or throwing NPCs around. These actions are exaggerated and presented in a humorous, non-graphic way. There is no blood or gore. References to fictional substances (like smoking pine cones) appear in a light-hearted, non-realistic context. No sexual content, real drug use, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<strong>Brutal Management</strong> is a game about growing your own business, where any sense of order depends entirely on your decisions, your willpower, and your ability to handle everything that suddenly goes wrong.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1867075a116eb622129f51f03f67eb6e.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1867075a116eb622129f51f03f67eb6e.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1867075a116eb622129f51f03f67eb6e.mp4?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You\u2019re in charge of everything \u2014 and everyone. Your team is fully at your disposal: direct them, command them, push them to work, or force them into action if you must. But remember \u2014 they\u2019re not mindless machines. They have moods, reactions, and their own understanding of what\u2019s happening.<br>They behave naturally and unpredictably because they\u2019re driven by <strong>physics</strong> and their interaction with the world \u2014 and that\u2019s exactly why they feel so <strong>alive</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1e350f2b7a6533108125377771c349ee.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1e350f2b7a6533108125377771c349ee.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1e350f2b7a6533108125377771c349ee.mp4?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This isn\u2019t a boring simulator where you drown in routine. There\u2019s always something happening: events shift rapidly, plans fall apart, and the environment constantly keeps you on your toes. You\u2019ll encounter funny moments, unexpected reactions, a lively workspace, and even a dog who interferes with the workflow as if it\u2019s written into his job description.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1f1b5ab6df726f0038417d600df5af83.poster.avif?t=1764387753\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135820/extras/1f1b5ab6df726f0038417d600df5af83.webm?t=1764387753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar